From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@pmos.laurel.invalid>
Date: 2026-08-03
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout: enable Adreno 610 GPU

Habilita la GPU Adreno 610 (nodos añadidos en sm6125.dtsi por el
parche 0002) desde sm61x5-mainline barni2000/7.0-develop:
- &adreno_smmu, &gmu_wrapper, &gpucc status okay
- &gpu status okay + zap-shader qcom/sm6125/xiaomi/laurel/a610_zap.mbn

Nota: el firmware a610_zap.mbn no está aún empaquetado (fase de
firmware). Si falta, la GPU queda sin zap y se degrada; el sistema
sigue arrancando con llvmpipe. GPU = fase 2.


Signed-off-by: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@pmos.laurel.invalid>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts | 21 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts
--- laurel-v71.dts	2026-08-02 23:24:34.025585711 -0500
+++ laurel-gpu.dts	2026-08-02 23:41:16.573092179 -0500
@@ -404,8 +404,29 @@
 		bias-disable;
 	};
 };
 
+&adreno_smmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gmu_wrapper {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+
+	zap-shader {
+		firmware-name = "qcom/sm6125/xiaomi/laurel/a610_zap.mbn";
+	};
+};
+
+&gpucc {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+
 &sdc2_on_state {
 	sd-cd-pins {
 		pins = "gpio98";
 		function = "gpio";

